// Each CRDT's `merge` takes its own type — you cannot merge a GCounter with a GSet. The extern-
// type method signatures make this a *static* error (extern-types X1): the checker rejects the
// mismatched argument at check time, a preview of the compile-time `Mergeable` safety the synced-
// signal surface will build on.
// expect: error E0007 at 10:5
// expect: exit 1
use para.{crdt}
a = crdt.gcounter()
b = crdt.gset()
c = a.merge(b)
echo c.value()
